"this" keyword details are present in the this.js

Important note
this with the arrow function works same as the outer scope as the arrow function does not know about the this keyword,
so "this" inside the arrow function behaves like its present outside that arrow function.


Quick Reference
Context                          this refers to
Global scope                     window / global
Regular function                 window / undefined (strict)
Object method                    The object itself
Arrow function                   Outer/lexical scope
Class constructor                New instance being created
Event listener                   The DOM element
call / apply / bind              Whatever you pass in
